    "Lo rechazaste o es de otra persona, y en Ajustes pediste solo los eventos a los que asistes. Si guardas avisos aquí, este evento sonará igual." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You declined it or it belongs to someone else, and in Settings you asked for only the events you attend. If you save alerts here, this event rings anyway."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
